      "source": "Extension of <a href=\"../../../handler/invocation/reactive/AbstractEncoderMethodReturnValueHandler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.messaging.handler.invocation.reactive\"><code>AbstractEncoderMethodReturnValueHandler</code></a> that\n<a href=\"#handleEncodedContent(reactor.core.publisher.Flux,org.springframework.core.MethodParameter,org.springframework.messaging.Message)\"><code>handles</code></a> encoded content by wrapping data buffers\nas RSocket payloads and by passing those through the <a href=\"#RESPONSE_HEADER\"><code>RESPONSE_HEADER</code></a>\nheader.",
